I wrote the patch because the first time I cut down a tree, I was
surprised that it just vanished into thin air. I decided on clubs and
quarterstaves because it makes sense to me that tree branches could be
used as those weapons. Arrows seem less likely, and where would the
feathers come from?

The clubs and staves are randomly generated just like all the other stuff
you find lying around in the dungeon. So, yes, you could get a blessed +5
quarterstaff if you were lucky.

